{"task_id": "7f4c155a609e76eb", "model_key": "longcat-2-5-preview-free", "raw_response": "We need 8^4 mod 1009.\n\n8^4 = 4096.\n\nDivide by 1009: 1009 × 4 = 4036, and 4096 − 4036 = 60.\n\nSo the least nonnegative residue is 60.\n\n{\"answer\": \"60\"}", "parsed_answer": "60", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 8172, "usage": {"input": 286, "output": 235, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 151, "totalTokens": 521, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "cost_usd": 0, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "longcat-2.5-preview-free", "api": "openai-completions", "thinkingLevel": "off", "responseId": "c437a71e80714a8ebb79355c176359fb"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-17T16:38:34+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-17T16:38:42+00:00"}
{"task_id": "ddf08adedd267f7f", "model_key": "longcat-2-5-preview-free", "raw_response": "The constant term of a product of linear factors is the product of each factor's constant term.\n\nConstant terms: 1, 3, 4, −5, 4.\n\nProduct: 1 · 3 · 4 · (−5) · 4 = −240.\n\n{\"answer\": \"-240\"}", "parsed_answer": "-240", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 11432, "usage": {"input": 242, "output": 420, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 346, "totalTokens": 662, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "cost_usd": 0, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "longcat-2.5-preview-free", "api": "openai-completions", "thinkingLevel": "off", "responseId": "9b31c271b11d48e782f681b8d33d0c4e"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-17T16:38:34+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-17T16:38:45+00:00"}
{"task_id": "d209ea052284914a", "model_key": "longcat-2-5-preview-free", "raw_response": "Using cofactor expansion along the first row:\n\nOnly the entry in row 1, column 3 is nonzero: \\(-2\\).\n\nIts minor is:\n\\[\n\\begin{vmatrix}\n-3 & 3 \\\\\n1 & -3\n\\end{vmatrix}\n= (-3)(-3) - (3)(1) = 9 - 3 = 6\n\\]\n\nSince the cofactor sign for position \\((1,3)\\) is positive:\n\\[\n\\det(A) = (-2)(6) = -12\n\\]\n\n{\"answer\": \"-12\"}", "parsed_answer": "-12", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 13781, "usage": {"input": 235, "output": 610, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 492, "totalTokens": 845, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "cost_usd": 0, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "longcat-2.5-preview-free", "api": "openai-completions", "thinkingLevel": "off", "responseId": "30aaa7c2e3094472b32e0bfcbfe8e517"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-17T16:38:34+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-17T16:38:47+00:00"}
