{"task_id": "acf03d9cf5b82cdc", "model_key": "longcat-2-5-preview-free", "raw_response": "At \\(x=-1\\), the factor values are\n\n\\[\n-4,\\ 5,\\ 3,\\ 1,\\ 11,\\ -2\n\\]\n\nso\n\n\\[\nf(-1)=(-4)(5)(3)(1)(11)(-2)=1320.\n\\]\n\nUsing \\(f'/f=\\sum g_i'/g_i\\),\n\n\\[\n\\frac{f'(-1)}{f(-1)}\n= \\frac6{-4}+\\frac{-6}{5}+\\frac{-3}{3}+\\frac{-4}{1}+\\frac{-5}{11}+\\frac9{-2}\n= -\\frac{696}{55}.\n\\]\n\nThus\n\n\\[\nf'(-1)=1320\\left(-\\frac{696}{55}\\right)=-16704.\n\\]\n\n{\"answer\": \"-16704\"}", "parsed_answer": "-16704", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 29924, "usage": {"input": 272, "output": 1057, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 880, "totalTokens": 1329, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "cost_usd": 0, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "longcat-2.5-preview-free", "api": "openai-completions", "thinkingLevel": "off", "responseId": "db407a0f1c7c448798016f27086f2058"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-17T16:38:47+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-17T16:39:17+00:00"}
