{"task_id": "34ad086f18b6dda2", "model_key": "longcat-2-5-preview-free", "raw_response": "Using row reduction, the determinant reduces to \\(\\frac{1}{8}\\det\\begin{pmatrix}1&13&5\\\\-19&5&9\\\\-11&-11&-15\\end{pmatrix}=\\frac{-3648}{8}=-456\\).\n{\"answer\": \"-456\"}", "parsed_answer": "-456", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 69686, "usage": {"input": 254, "output": 2932, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 2861, "totalTokens": 3186, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "cost_usd": 0, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "longcat-2.5-preview-free", "api": "openai-completions", "thinkingLevel": "off", "responseId": "5dda88b354e74541a42b02aac906855a"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-17T16:38:59+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-17T16:40:08+00:00"}
{"task_id": "bf11352b940ce579", "model_key": "longcat-2-5-preview-free", "raw_response": "The polynomial is a product of eight linear factors. The coefficient of \\(x^2\\) in the expansion is obtained by choosing the \\(x\\) term from exactly two factors and the constant term from the remaining six.\n\nList each factor as \\((a_i x + b_i)\\):\n\n\\[\n\\begin{array}{c|c|c}\ni & a_i & b_i\\\\\\hline\n1 & 3 & -3\\\\\n2 & 7 & -2\\\\\n3 & -8 & -2\\\\\n4 & 5 & -7\\\\\n5 & -5 & -2\\\\\n6 & -8 & -6\\\\\n7 & -4 & 3\\\\\n8 & 9 & -7\n\\end{array}\n\\]\n\nThe product of all constant terms is\n\\[\nB = (-3)(-2)(-2)(-7)(-2)(-6)(3)(-7) = -21168.\n\\]\n\nLet \\(r_i = a_i/b_i\\). Then the coefficient of \\(x^2\\) equals \\(B \\cdot e_2(r_1,\\dots,r_8)\\), where \\(e_2\\) is the elementary symmetric sum of degree 2.\n\nCompute the ratios:\n\\[\nr_1=-1,\\; r_2=-\\frac{7}{2},\\; r_3=4,\\; r_4=-\\frac{5}{7},\\; r_5=\\frac{5}{2},\\; r_6=\\frac{4}{3},\\; r_7=-\\frac{4}{3},\\; r_8=-\\frac{9}{7}.\n\\]\n\nTheir sum is\n\\[\nS_1 = \\sum r_i = -1 -\\frac{7}{2} + 4 - \\frac{5}{7} + \\frac{5}{2} + \\frac{4}{3} - \\frac{4}{3} - \\frac{9}{7} = 0.\n\\]\n\nThe sum of squares is\n\\[\nS_2 = 1 + \\frac{49}{4} + 16 + \\frac{25}{49} + \\frac{25}{4} + \\frac{16}{9} + \\frac{16}{9} + \\frac{81}{49}\n= 17 + \\frac{37}{2} + \\frac{32}{9} + \\frac{106}{49}\n= \\frac{36355}{882}.\n\\]\n\nSince \\(S_1 = 0\\), we have \\(e_2 = \\frac{S_1^2 - S_2}{2} = -\\frac{S_2}{2} = -\\frac{36355}{1764}\\).\n\nThus the desired coefficient is\n\\[\nB \\cdot e_2 = (-21168)\\left(-\\frac{36355}{1764}\\right) = \\frac{21168}{1764} \\cdot 36355 = 12 \\cdot 36355 = 436260.\n\\]\n\nThis result is confirmed by sequentially multiplying the factors while keeping only terms up to \\(x^2\\).\n\n{\"answer\": \"436260\"}", "parsed_answer": "436260", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 198049, "usage": {"input": 263, "output": 10572, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 9891, "totalTokens": 10835, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "cost_usd": 0, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "longcat-2.5-preview-free", "api": "openai-completions", "thinkingLevel": "off", "responseId": "e430949eb4d84eaba547962ae2ba1cc5"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-17T16:38:42+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-17T16:42:00+00:00"}
{"task_id": "ff727ac29c46eac0", "model_key": "longcat-2-5-preview-free", "raw_response": "The polynomial has 12 linear factors, so the coefficient of x^11 comes from choosing the constant term from exactly one factor and the x-term from the other eleven:\n\ncoefficient = ∏cⱼ · Σ(dᵢ/cᵢ)\n\nwhere each factor is cᵢx + dᵢ.\n\nThe coefficients cᵢ are: −13, 4, −7, 11, −11, −7, 10, 9, 8, −1, 13, 3, giving\n\nC = ∏cⱼ = −8,657,288,640.\n\nThe ratios dᵢ/cᵢ sum to:\n\n9/13 − 3/7 − 3/11 + 3/5 − 10/9 − 13/3 + 15 = 457052/45045.\n\nSo the coefficient is:\n\n−8,657,288,640 · (457052/45045) = −192,192 · 457,052 = −87,841,737,984.\n\n{\"answer\": \"-87841737984\"}", "parsed_answer": "-87841737984", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 192632, "usage": {"input": 298, "output": 11080, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 10775, "totalTokens": 11378, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "cost_usd": 0, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "longcat-2.5-preview-free", "api": "openai-completions", "thinkingLevel": "off", "responseId": "c0bb518e8ae24d37add36b587589b65d"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-17T16:39:19+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-17T16:42:32+00:00"}
