{"task_id": "6a8d4ce75edde7d4", "model_key": "longcat-2-5-preview-free", "raw_response": "## Setting up the closed form\n\nThe characteristic polynomial is $x^2+8x-9=(x-1)(x+9)$, so\n\n$$a_n = A(1)^n + B(-9)^n.$$\n\nFrom $a_0=-7$: $A+B=-7$; from $a_1=7$: $A-9B=7$. Subtracting gives $10B=-14$, so $B=-\\tfrac75$, $A=-\\tfrac{28}{5}$:\n\n$$a_n=-\\frac{7}{5}\\left((-9)^n+4\\right).$$\n\nCheck: $a_2=-\\frac75(85)=-119=-8(7)+9(-7)$ ✓.\n\n## Working mod $p=1000003$\n\nSince $102$ is even, $(-9)^{102}=9^{102}$, so\n\n$$a_{102}\\equiv -\\frac{7}{5}\\left(9^{102}+4\\right) \\pmod p .$$\n\n**Inverse of 5:** $5\\cdot 600002 = 3000010 = 3p+1$, so $5^{-1}\\equiv 600002$.\n\n**Powers of 9 by repeated squaring:**\n\n| power | computation | value mod $p$ |\n|---|---|---|\n| $9^2$ | $81$ | $81$ |\n| $9^4$ | $81^2$ | $6561$ |\n| $9^8$ | $6561^2=43046721$; $-43p$ | $46592$ |\n| $9^{16}$ | $46592^2=2170814464$; $-2170p$ | $807954$ |\n| $9^{32}$ | $807954^2=652789666116$; $-652787p$ | $707755$ |\n| $9^{64}$ | $707755^2=500917140025$; $-500915p$ | $637280$ |\n\nNow $102 = 64+32+4+2$:\n\n- $9^{96}\\equiv 637280\\cdot 707755 = 451038106400 \\equiv 753292$\n- $9^{100}\\equiv 753292\\cdot 6561 = 4942348812 \\equiv 333986$\n- $9^{102}\\equiv 333986\\cdot 81 = 27052866 \\equiv 52785$\n\nSo $9^{102}+4\\equiv 52789$.\n\n## Finishing\n\n$$a_{102}\\equiv -7\\cdot 52789\\cdot 600002 = -369523\\cdot 600002 .$$\n\nCompute $369523\\cdot 600002 = 221714539046$, and $221714539046-221713p = 221714539046-221713665139 = 873907$.\n\nTherefore\n$$a_{102}\\equiv -873907 \\equiv 1000003-873907 = 126096 \\pmod{1000003}.$$\n\n(Equivalently, $-369523\\equiv 630480$ and $630480\\cdot 600002 = 378289260960 \\equiv 126096$, confirming the result.)\n\n{\"answer\": \"126096\"}", "parsed_answer": "126096", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 233987, "usage": {"input": 7, "output": 12206, "cacheRead": 256, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 11253, "totalTokens": 12469, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "cost_usd": 0, "attempts": 2, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "longcat-2.5-preview-free", "api": "openai-completions", "thinkingLevel": "off", "responseId": "d3734a107b4d4c56acfb16c7970388d5"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-17T16:39:10+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-17T16:47:06+00:00"}
